  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, a kineticist transcends the distinction between the different elements and can bend all creation to their will. By accepting 1 point of burn (in addition to any burn requirement of the kinetic blast they choose), they can use any blast wild talent they don’t know.</p>\n<p>By accepting 1 point of burn as a standard action (except for battle burn), they can change any of their wild talents into any other wild talent of the same category (such as simple blasts or defense) for 24 hours, ignoring any elemental requirements or restrictions (but not any other requirements or restrictions).</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/legendary-kineticist#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
